<LegalPage
  eyebrow="Accessibility"
  heading="Web Accessibility"
  lede="Beautiful things should be easy for everyone to reach."
>
  <p>Mir Kash is committed to making mirkash.com welcoming and usable for as many people as possible, including those who rely on assistive technologies such as screen readers, magnification, or keyboard navigation. Accessibility is not a one-time task for us &mdash; it is an ongoing part of how we build and care for our website.</p>

  <h2>Our approach</h2>
  <p>We design and develop our website with accessibility in mind, and review it regularly as we add new features and stories. Among the measures we take:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Meaningful, structured headings so pages can be navigated by their outline.</li>
    <li>Descriptive text alternatives for images and product photography.</li>
    <li>Keyboard access to interactive elements, with visible focus states.</li>
    <li>Colour and contrast chosen for legibility, with text that reflows on any screen size.</li>
    <li>Clear, plain language in our navigation, forms, and labels.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Standards we aim for</h2>
  <p>We use the <strong>Web Content Accessibility Guidelines (WCAG) 2.1, Level AA</strong> as our reference. These internationally recognised guidelines help make web content more perceivable, operable, understandable, and robust for people with a wide range of abilities. While we work toward conformance across the site, we cannot guarantee that every page is fully conformant at all times.</p>

  <h2>Ongoing effort &amp; known limitations</h2>
  <p>Accessibility is a continuing commitment. We test and improve our website over time, and some areas may not yet be fully optimised. Certain content supplied by third parties &mdash; such as embedded checkout, payment, or social media components &mdash; is not always within our direct control, and its accessibility may vary. Where we can influence these, we do.</p>

  <h2>Tell us how we&rsquo;re doing</h2>
  <p>If you encounter any difficulty using our website, or have a suggestion that would help us improve, we genuinely want to hear from you. Please tell us the page and what you were trying to do, along with the device, browser, or assistive technology you were using, so we can look into it quickly.</p>
  <p>Write to us at <a href="mailto:info@mirkashco.com">info@mirkashco.com</a> and we&rsquo;ll do our best to help and to make it right.</p>
</LegalPage>
